{"comment_text": {"ja65:0.1": "", "ja65:0.2": "", "ja65:0.3": "", "ja65:0.4": "", "ja65:1.1": "The story tells us that women are available to all, so the wise do not get upset when they are unfaithful. | Contrary to the story, studies consistently indicate that men cheat more than women. ", "ja65:1.2": "Compare <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn9.8/en/sujato'>SN 9.8</a>. ", "ja65:1.3": "", "ja65:1.4": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Nāsaṁ</i> is <i lang='pi' translate='no'>na</i> + <i lang='pi' translate='no'>āsaṁ</i>, genitive plural feminine pronoun. ", "ja65:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja65:0.1": "<article id='ja65'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja65:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja65:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja65:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja65:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja65:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja65:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja65:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja65:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja65:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja65:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja65:0.3": "Itthivagga ", "ja65:0.4": "5. Anabhiratijātaka ", "ja65:1.1": "“Yathā nadī ca pantho ca, ", "ja65:1.2": "pānāgāraṁ sabhā papā; ", "ja65:1.3": "Evaṁ lokitthiyo nāma, ", "ja65:1.4": "nāsaṁ kujjhanti paṇḍitā”ti. ", "ja65:2.1": "Anabhiratijātakaṁ pañcamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja65:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 65 ", "ja65:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja65:0.3": "Women ", "ja65:0.4": "Dissatisfaction: a past life story ", "ja65:1.1": "Just like rivers and roads, ", "ja65:1.2": "taverns, hotels, and pubs, ", "ja65:1.3": "are those called women in the world. ", "ja65:1.4": "Sages do not get angry with them. ", "ja65:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja65:0.1": "", "ja65:0.2": "", "ja65:0.3": "", "ja65:0.4": "", "ja65:1.1": "csp1ed22.16, csp2ed22.16, ms22J_143, msdiv65, pts-vp-pli1.302", "ja65:1.2": "", "ja65:1.3": "", "ja65:1.4": "", "ja65:2.1": "ms22J_144"}, "keys_order": ["ja65:0.1", "ja65:0.2", "ja65:0.3", "ja65:0.4", "ja65:1.1", "ja65:1.2", "ja65:1.3", "ja65:1.4", "ja65:2.1"]}